    },
    "regime_notes": "Raw trend signal was negative at 5d/10d/20d and was direction-inverted for admission. Inverted 10d IC was positive in 2023-25 (+0.011605), 2026-28 (+0.063576), 2029-31 (+0.093081), and 2032-09/30 (+0.056623). Small 15-asset cross-section; interpret uncertainty conservatively.",
